  "description": "For as long as I can remember, I've been fascinated by violence. But the fixation turned out to be a disguised longing for pain, and in turn, my deepest, darkest secret. I can't let anyone find out, but I also can't help but wonder - will I ever find someone to quench my desires? Or will my fantasy remain unfulfilled... forever? What lies in the end of a pain-fueled revenge?! \n\n*Editor's Comment: This comic contains graphic depictions of rape and violence. Reader discretion is advised.* \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
